  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🌲 dsh-workspace-tree",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <strong>English</strong> | <strong><a href=\"./README.zh.md\">简体中文</a></strong>\n</p>\n\n> **Virtual Session Folder Grouping, Move-to-Folder Menu, and In-App Visual Directory Browser for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).**\n\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/pipipigu/dsh-workspace-tree)\n[](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[](https://vitest.dev/)\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Sidebar Overview & Core Features",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. In-App Visual Directory Browser & Workspace Creator",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Precision Click-to-Move Folder Menu",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **📁 Virtual Session Folders**\n  - **Zero Filesystem Pollution**: Never moves or modifies underlying conversation logs or physical directories. Metadata is atomically persisted at `.dsh/workspace-tree.json`.\n  - **Multi-Workspace Stability**: Independent classification and pin queue per workspace. Folders remain persistent and stable across workspace switches.\n  - **Full Folder Lifecycle**: Create, inline rename (double-click), custom color badge, and delete (internal sessions safely fallback to uncategorized)."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **➕ Folder-Scoped Session Creation**\n  - Hover on any folder and click **`[+]`** to start a new conversation **directly inside that targeted folder** with atomic SessionId binding, avoiding race conditions."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **🚀 Active Task Banner & Read-to-Dismiss**\n  - **Compact 28px Top Capsule**: Pins active running tasks and unread completed conversations at the top of the sidebar.\n  - **Smooth Lifecycle Transition**: Pulsing blue dot during generation -> persistent green `[Unread]` badge when completed in background -> automatically dismissed upon reading.\n  - **Deep-Jump & Auto-Expand**: One-click navigation that automatically expands the parent workspace and folder."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **📂 Precision Move-to-Folder Dropdown Menu**\n  - **Zero Misclicks**: Replaced awkward sidebar drag-and-drop with a crisp, reliable click-to-move dropdown menu.\n  - **Instant Categorization**: Quick folder selection or inline new folder creation; dedicated eject button inside folders to return sessions to uncategorized."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **🗂️ In-App Visual Directory Browser & Workspace Creator**\n  - **One-Click Visual Adoption**: Click **`[+]`** on the sidebar header to open a native-feeling \"Select Workspace Directory\" modal dialog.\n  - **Full Hierarchy Navigation**: Home directory jump, breadcrumb navigation, single-click selection, double-click/chevron drill-down, and up-level button.\n  - **Inline Folder Creation & Hidden Files**: Create new subdirectories directly in the dialog and toggle hidden files (`.config`, etc.).\n  - **Direct Path Editing**: Click the pen icon to switch to raw path typing/pasting.\n  - **Zero Slot Conflicts**: Self-contained host RPC and UI, completely bypassing DSH internal slot conflicts with 100% stability across Web and Desktop."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **📌 Session Pinning, Inline Rename & Pagination**\n  - Pin important sessions to the top of the workspace.\n  - Double-click any session title to activate inline renaming.\n  - Displays top 10 sessions by default with an expander for remaining items.\n\n- **🎨 Native Single Slot Shadowing**\n  - Seamlessly shadows the native `sidebar.workspaces` slot with `priority: -10`, blending with DSH dark/light color schemes (`--dsw-*`).\n  - Pure SVG vector icons with zero emoji clutter."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "- **⚡ 0ms Reactive Engine (Version Snapshot)**\n  - Powered by `useSyncExternalStore` with immutable version increment snapshots, ensuring instant 0ms UI re-renders on any action.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Option A: Install from GitHub (Recommended)",
      "text": "Run the following command in your terminal:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:pipipigu/dsh-workspace-tree\n```\n\nRestart your DSH Web instance (or refresh the browser) to enjoy!"
    },
    {
      "section": "Option B: Local Development (Link Mode)",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "1. Clone repository",
      "text": "git clone https://github.com/pipipigu/dsh-workspace-tree.git\ncd dsh-workspace-tree"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. Install dependencies & build",
      "text": "pnpm install\npnpm build"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. Link to DSH Web Profile",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add link:$(pwd)\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
